{"type":"message_update","usage":{"input":2671,"output":270,"cacheRead":17536,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":137,"totalTokens":20477,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0,"totalFromProvider":true}},"assistantMessageEvent":{"type":"thinking_end","contentIndex":0,"content":"The fix looks correct. The error message format is exactly as required: `{seq:06d}.ots is missing` which will produce `000002.ots is missing` for entry 2.\n\nAll existing tests pass. The fix:\n1. Tracks all sequence numbers that have a verified Sigstore attestation (in `sigstore_heads`)\n2. After processing all anchors, checks that each such sequence number has a corresponding `.ots` file\n3. If missing, adds a \"BAD\" message with the format `NNNNNN.ots is missing`\n4. The existing behavior is preserved when the proof is present\n\nThe task is complete."}}
